back end service over HTTP.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:37.770
So anything that's in the back
end folder and has extension

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.840
.jsw, which stands like
JavaScript read method,

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:46.340
any function exported from there
will become callable as a web

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.630
service.

